t,d,b=pages['/about/']; pages['/about/']=(t,d,b+'<section class="feature"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET THE MONK IN THE FIELD</p><h2>Close experience.<br>First-hand knowledge.</h2><p>Michael with a giant hornet, from his personal video archive. The original video is titled “How to handle a giant hornet. (DO NOT TRY THIS).”</p><a class="text-link" href="/journal/video-archive/">Explore the field videos</a></div><div>'+field_video('SUATzwynFsI')+'</div></section>')
